+		insmod moal.ko plinkstats=1            : Enable link statistics prints
+		insmod moal.ko plinkstats=2            : Reset link statistics prints
+		insmod moal.ko plinkstats=1,0x7,5,0    : Enable Num TX Packets, Num RX Packets and Channel prints on dmesg.
+		insmod moal.ko plinkstats=1,0xf,5,1    : Enable Num TX Packets, Num RX Packets, Channel and Region prints on dmesg, and netlink event also enabled.
+	Note:
+		1. For more details about plinkstats parameters, refer plinkstats command details in README_MLAN file.
+		2. When changing drvdbg mask dynamically while running test, set MLSTATS bit(0x800) along with the change, if wifi logging feature is enabled.
