+ * Minimum payload len is sum of a must required fields length for Wi-Fi
+ * ==========================================================================
+ * |  ID  |    |   |PAY |   ID    |    |   |   | PAY|   |  META  | META|DATA|
+ * |(UUID)|FLAG|LEN|LOAD|(PUB KEY)|FLAG|LEN|PAD|LOAD|PAD|DATA LEN|MAGIC|CRC |
+ * ==========================================================================
