+/**
+ *  @brief remove ra_list from pendiing TX queues
+ *
+ *  @param priv        A pointer to mlan_private
+ *  @param pmadapter   A pointer to pmlan_adapter
+ *  @param ra_list     A pointer to raListTbl
+ *
