+/**
+ * @brief Vendor cmd to trigger the aggrpriotbl.
+ *	It sets or gets the aggrpriotbl
+ *
+ * @param wiphy    A pointer to wiphy struct
+ * @param wdev     A pointer to wireless_dev struct
